004500     05  ERR-SW                   PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
           05  EDIT-ADDTL-DATA-SW       PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
004600
004700 01  WORK-AREA.
004800     05  BUILD-VALID-DEPT-KEY.
004900         10  DEPT-PREFIX          PIC XX   VALUE "DP".
005000         10  DEPT-NUM             PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
005100
005200     05  BUILD-EXPENSE-CLASS.
005300         10  FILLER               PIC X(2) VALUE "EC".
005400         10  EXPENSE-CLASS        PIC X(6) VALUE SPACES.
005500
005600     05  BUILD-NEW-WORK.
005700         10  FILLER               PIC X(2) VALUE "NW".
005800         10  NEW-WORK             PIC X(6) VALUE SPACES.
005900
